WEBVTT

00:00:19.130 --> 00:00:19.810
Spectacular.

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:40.630
- Yeah, yeah.

00:01:05.340 --> 00:01:06.740
Inspector Getzer

00:01:06.740 --> 00:01:12.410
Winter Olympic Games

00:01:12.410 --> 00:01:14.450
Winterland

00:01:14.450 --> 00:01:16.450
A beautiful distance in the mountains

00:01:16.450 --> 00:01:18.450
Where athletes from all over the world gather

00:01:18.450 --> 00:01:20.650
To watch the Olympic Games

00:01:24.760 --> 00:01:26.760
The time has come

00:01:26.760 --> 00:01:28.760
To show the world

00:01:28.760 --> 00:01:29.760
The power of magic

00:01:31.180 --> 00:01:34.710
- It's not me. - It's him!

00:01:38.960 --> 00:01:44.240
- What brings you to Winterland, girl? - I'm here with my uncle. There he is!

00:02:20.220 --> 00:02:23.140
I'm very impressed, I'm one of the most famous detectives in the world.

00:02:25.280 --> 00:02:26.280
I'm on vacation.

00:02:35.050 --> 00:02:37.610
Are you sure that the boss with me doesn't know where you are?

00:02:37.610 --> 00:02:42.070
Yes, Penny, I took a week off and I'm absolutely...

00:02:42.070 --> 00:02:45.400
And more, totally on vacation!

00:02:45.400 --> 00:02:47.210
What?

00:02:47.210 --> 00:02:49.650
Paulus, it's the secret getcha phone!

00:02:49.650 --> 00:02:52.950
It's the boss, sir.

00:02:55.280 --> 00:02:56.950
Where is he?

00:03:00.060 --> 00:03:02.060
Here! Here!

00:03:02.060 --> 00:03:04.580
I'm sorry for interrupting your holidays.

00:03:04.580 --> 00:03:10.660
Take all precautions. Dr. Klaus is in Winterland. This message will be self-destructed.

00:03:10.660 --> 00:03:17.730
Don't worry, boss. I always do my duty.

00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:33.470
The doctor won't dare to show his face!

00:03:35.620 --> 00:03:37.520
That's what you think!

00:03:39.520 --> 00:03:42.220
Gadget hasn't seen my real tent!

00:03:42.640 --> 00:03:54.910
You stupid!

00:03:55.010 --> 00:03:58.260
In Gadget's house, I provoke an avalanche!

00:03:58.370 --> 00:04:00.000
Yes, sir! I'm sure of it!

00:04:09.920 --> 00:04:15.750
Hey, Penny, the innocent singer is going right to my bracelet.

00:04:15.750 --> 00:04:21.040
Brain, I don't look like an innocent singer.

00:04:22.020 --> 00:04:23.700
Stop, stop, my good man.

00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:25.450
Look at him.

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:30.000
One more step forward, good man, and I'll give you my bracelet.

00:04:30.060 --> 00:04:34.990
I'm sorry!

00:04:34.990 --> 00:04:46.870
I'm sorry!

00:04:46.870 --> 00:04:48.950
I need a music sheet!

00:04:48.950 --> 00:04:54.430
I think I've got the key!

00:04:54.430 --> 00:04:57.570
Oh, oh, there it is!

00:04:57.570 --> 00:04:59.640
Let's see...

00:05:47.470 --> 00:05:50.470
"Hey, little frog, I'm sorry, let me shake you!"

00:05:50.470 --> 00:05:52.370
"Oh, don't even think about it!"

00:05:52.370 --> 00:05:58.150
"Huh? Mountain people are weird!"

00:05:58.150 --> 00:06:00.000
"Ha ha ha ha!"

00:06:09.050 --> 00:06:22.080
What's going on, Benny?

00:06:33.550 --> 00:06:35.550
Chief Quimby! It's not the bear!

00:06:35.550 --> 00:06:37.440
There's an agent over there!

00:06:37.440 --> 00:06:41.390
Balls! It's one of the agents of Dr. Clown!

00:06:45.950 --> 00:06:47.950
The athlete that carries the bandage has dynamite!

00:06:47.950 --> 00:06:50.880
Stop! This message will be self-destructed!

00:06:50.880 --> 00:06:53.220
Don't worry! I'll catch him!

00:06:53.220 --> 00:07:00.000
Chief Quimby! The gentleman is here!

00:07:00.730 --> 00:07:02.730
Why do you know them?

00:07:02.730 --> 00:07:08.790
Stop it!

00:07:08.790 --> 00:07:14.100
Unidentified skier is in trouble!

00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:24.880
Stay calm, Brian! With my catch-up snow veil, we'll be taken to the ramp!

00:07:30.410 --> 00:07:35.220
*laughter*

00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:40.370
Something we can't forget!

00:07:40.370 --> 00:07:43.540
We speed up to verify the wind first!

00:07:43.540 --> 00:07:46.160
I'm going to fill my gadget coat!

00:08:02.780 --> 00:08:06.820
And this serves as a lesson for the next time you try to blow up someone's balloon!

00:08:15.280 --> 00:08:16.500
There's Logron!

00:08:16.720 --> 00:08:18.890
Huh? You're mistaken!

00:08:21.810 --> 00:08:23.380
It's Dinamite!

00:08:26.970 --> 00:08:28.030
Brain, are you there?

00:08:28.030 --> 00:08:28.670
Wow, wow!

00:08:29.460 --> 00:08:30.000
I know that the...

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:42.930
I'm going to help you, Gadget!

00:08:42.930 --> 00:08:47.260
Get rid of this dynamite before it explodes!

00:08:55.080 --> 00:09:00.000
Get out of here! I'm going to get rid of this thing!

00:09:02.750 --> 00:09:09.320
Huh? This guy is making me nervous!

00:09:22.570 --> 00:09:25.510
Why are you so forced to throw the trash? Huh?

00:09:27.240 --> 00:09:28.200
A good height!

00:09:34.540 --> 00:09:55.950
- Watch out, Mad Agents! Eliminate Gadget! - Nothing like a little bit of oil, for things to slide better.

00:10:00.120 --> 00:10:04.180
*crying*

00:10:04.180 --> 00:10:14.110
*crying*

00:10:14.110 --> 00:10:20.350
Stop it, get out of that turn!

00:10:20.350 --> 00:10:22.520
But, wait...

00:10:22.520 --> 00:10:24.020
Inspector Gadget?

00:10:24.020 --> 00:10:26.150
But of course!

00:10:26.150 --> 00:10:28.150
*laughing*

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:39.110
That's right! We just saved the Olympic city from this fight with Dinamite!

00:11:00.890 --> 00:11:08.160
- You have to take care of me! - Particular lessons, huh?

00:11:08.160 --> 00:11:12.110
I have an idea to finish Gadget once and for all!

00:11:21.220 --> 00:11:25.030
We were close!

00:11:32.040 --> 00:11:34.840
This is the busiest ski school I've ever seen!

00:11:34.840 --> 00:11:37.530
But it's beautiful, Penny!

00:11:37.530 --> 00:11:39.970
Look at this fantastic architecture!

00:11:41.100 --> 00:11:46.270
The Interland Ski School!

00:11:46.270 --> 00:11:48.720
The first automatic space in the world!

00:11:48.720 --> 00:11:51.030
Hmm, this voice doesn't seem strange to me.

00:11:51.030 --> 00:11:57.330
It must be the automatic cable car!

00:11:57.330 --> 00:12:00.000
Ah, the wonders of the modern age!

00:12:02.300 --> 00:12:04.800
*Growls*

00:12:04.800 --> 00:12:11.700
Come on, Brain! It's allowed to enter here!

00:12:11.700 --> 00:12:19.300
The cable car runs a distance of 10 kilometers and it's the tallest in the world!

00:12:19.300 --> 00:12:28.840
Do you think this is safe?

00:12:30.480 --> 00:12:39.730
You'll see, I'll call the Detention Department.

00:12:39.730 --> 00:12:50.830
Your first ski lesson will be at the beginning of the track.

00:12:50.830 --> 00:12:55.170
It will not only be the first, but also the last.

00:12:55.170 --> 00:12:57.170
Is the pig still?

00:12:58.130 --> 00:13:00.000
I've never heard of it.

00:13:00.090 --> 00:13:03.800
I'm not going to be able to do this.

00:13:03.800 --> 00:13:07.710
Oh, really? You're very wrong, Gadget!

00:13:17.610 --> 00:13:21.390
It's okay, Penny. You can relax and enjoy the view.

00:13:44.840 --> 00:13:48.930
and I'm going to shoot it down with my umbrella gadget!

00:13:48.930 --> 00:13:53.110
Go umbrella gadget! Go umbrella!

00:13:53.110 --> 00:13:56.120
Go umbrella! Go umbrella!

00:14:01.790 --> 00:14:07.510
I mean, as long as you have your feet on the ground, nothing can go wrong, the problem is to keep your feet on the ground.

00:14:08.770 --> 00:14:10.410
This is empty, uncle.

00:14:10.410 --> 00:14:14.050
The best thing about a modern room, Penny, is that it doesn't have a lot of people.

00:14:14.050 --> 00:14:18.820
But Uncle Gadget, there's not even an instructor here.

00:14:18.820 --> 00:14:24.430
Don't worry, Penny. Being a good skier, I'll show you how to do it.

00:14:28.310 --> 00:14:29.800
Good night!

00:14:30.830 --> 00:14:49.210
Calm down! Everything has turned into an Iceberg!

00:14:49.210 --> 00:14:53.210
We're going straight to the bottom of the water!

00:14:53.210 --> 00:14:56.800
Oh, Penny! There's no problem with me around!

00:14:56.800 --> 00:15:00.000
Go, go, forget it!

00:15:30.060 --> 00:15:32.560
You're really cold!

00:15:32.560 --> 00:15:33.540
Yes!

00:15:33.540 --> 00:15:35.260
Come here!

00:15:35.260 --> 00:15:36.260
Come here!

00:15:36.260 --> 00:15:37.260
Come here!

00:15:37.260 --> 00:15:38.260
Come here!

00:16:00.060 --> 00:16:11.330
I knew it! Another autodestructive message! Matt is using strange animals to ruin the games!

00:16:11.330 --> 00:16:13.950
Stay calm, boss!

00:16:13.950 --> 00:16:21.280
And now, Matt Cat, the Abominable Snowball Robot!

00:16:30.280 --> 00:16:33.980
It's a perfect panoramic view! I can see all of Winterland!

00:16:33.980 --> 00:16:37.560
I have a strange feeling that I'm being followed!

00:16:37.560 --> 00:16:44.670
It's weird, but so strange!

00:16:44.670 --> 00:16:50.080
Well then, let's go to Alice's Kitchen!

00:17:01.120 --> 00:17:08.920
What is this animal?

00:17:08.920 --> 00:17:29.920
You're big!

00:17:30.030 --> 00:17:33.480
You can't run away, you're surrounded!

00:17:53.250 --> 00:17:54.250
Why are you stuck?

00:17:54.250 --> 00:17:57.270
Does it matter to answer some questions?

00:17:57.270 --> 00:17:58.710
What?

00:18:01.820 --> 00:18:06.180
You knew you were going to escape, huh?

00:18:14.730 --> 00:18:18.750
Inspector Ketchad, this is your last chance to surrender!

00:18:18.750 --> 00:18:24.670
Ready! That's it!

00:18:25.550 --> 00:18:30.000
And now, test...

00:18:30.060 --> 00:18:33.460
Jump right away! The next contestant is in his place!

00:18:36.810 --> 00:18:39.350
Double jump!

00:18:40.890 --> 00:18:44.250
It's not working here, ok! We have to finish this, we have to see!

00:18:44.670 --> 00:18:46.950
Wait, look! It's amazing!

00:18:53.200 --> 00:18:56.760
Stay calm, Inspector Gadget has everything, he's in control!

00:18:57.930 --> 00:19:00.000
Excellent work, Robin!

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:02.000
It's snowing.

00:19:04.000 --> 00:19:07.220
The monster's network has no hypotheses.

00:19:07.220 --> 00:19:09.060
Brain, Brain.

00:19:09.920 --> 00:19:13.660
Take this laser from the pocket and follow Uncle Gadget.

00:19:16.750 --> 00:19:20.830
Now I'm going to synchronize my computer with the frequency of that monster.

00:19:22.940 --> 00:19:26.440
Brain, my loyal friend, what are you doing?

00:19:26.440 --> 00:19:28.200
You're freeing the suspect.

00:19:32.520 --> 00:19:38.080
"I've already captured the frequency!"

00:19:38.080 --> 00:19:48.950
"To steal public property is considered a crime!"

00:19:48.950 --> 00:19:52.120
"Now, monster, self-destruct!"

00:20:00.480 --> 00:20:01.640
That's strange!

00:20:01.640 --> 00:20:12.540
One day, Gadget, one day I'm going to catch you!

00:20:16.630 --> 00:20:18.770
Snow Monster!

00:20:18.770 --> 00:20:20.660
What did you do to my dog?

00:20:20.660 --> 00:20:21.790
Come back here!

00:20:21.790 --> 00:20:23.620
Come back!

00:20:30.480 --> 00:20:33.800
And the gold medal for the next show goes to...

00:20:37.220 --> 00:20:38.690
Inspector Gadget!

00:20:38.690 --> 00:20:40.280
Thank you! Thank you!

00:20:40.280 --> 00:20:43.300
I'm proud!

00:20:43.300 --> 00:20:49.990
And remember kids, snow sports require a lot of exercise and as in other sports, be careful!

00:20:49.990 --> 00:20:51.800
And follow the rules!

00:20:51.800 --> 00:20:54.360
You should never ski alone, right?

00:20:54.360 --> 00:20:57.880
And never forget the true spirit of a team!

00:20:57.880 --> 00:21:00.000
Ah! Ah! Ah!

00:21:02.750 --> 00:21:06.820
And as you can see, never let your dog ski!

00:21:35.470 --> 00:21:36.580
Thank you.
